# The cadrei lead, Sturdy build, as a tiny terminal mascot.
# One character per pixel; two pixel rows make one terminal row (half blocks). "." is transparent.
# A green headset band and ear cups around a clay monitor, a dark screen with ivory eyes and smile,
# the green status bar along the bottom of the screen, and two legs.
#
# G = #3D9F60  256:71  headset and status bar (tmux green, the status bar's own color)
# C = #C2603E  256:173 clay body and legs
# S = #2A2522  256:235 screen
# W = #FAF8F4  256:255 eyes and smile (ivory, the brand paper)
#
.GGGGGGGGGG.
G.CCCCCCCC.G
GCSWSSSSWSCG
.CSSSWWSSSC.
.CGGGGGGGGC.
..CC....CC..
